From c24864088c159bc32cbbe8de44f0372d754912ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blank <583957236@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 16:59:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(def): implement NetPartialPathCbk for memory control in
 normal NETS

- Add defrNetPartialPathCbkType enum (value 70)
- Implement callback trigger in paths/new_path grammar rules
- Trigger callback when Wire path count reaches allocation limit
- Clear Wire paths and Net rect/poly data after callback
- Similar pattern to existing SNetPartialPathCbk for SPECIALNETS

This allows users to process net wiring data in batches,
reducing peak memory for nets with large amounts of paths.
